## 🔥 Our Philosophy
We believe in a **live musical experience**, where each performance is unique and improvised.
The live side of the music is what got us thinking about how to compose for a collab between musicians and share our influences with the audience. We’ve got a lot of history and passion packed into our music. We’re here to share our love for techno music and some grooves. Join us on this journey and let’s vibe together.




